# Integration event catalog

Stripe-style domain facts consumed by the integration dispatcher (webhook-equivalent). Events are emitted **inside the aggregate TX** via `outbox_events`; relay and workers deliver asynchronously.

## Rules

| Rule | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| One event = one business fact | Past-tense PascalCase (`TourPublished`, not `PublishTour`) |
| Idempotency | `domainEventId` deterministic per transition |
| Snapshot at emit | `deliverySnapshot` frozen in outbox payload (Stripe `data.object` equivalent) |
| No provider HTTP in TX | Telegram/Slack only in integration delivery worker |

## Events

### `TourCreated`

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| Aggregate | `tour` |
| When | New tour row inserted |
| Payload | `{ tenantId, tourId }` (thin — internal consumers) |
| Consumers | Denali finance ledger (`workspace.manifest.json` events) |
| Integration | **Not** mapped to Telegram (use `TourPublished`) |

### `TourPublished` (v1)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| Aggregate | `tour` |
| When | `publishStatus` transitions to published/active, **including create-with-publish** |
| `domainEventId` | `TourPublished:{tourId}:{rowVersion}` |
| Consumers | Integration dispatcher → Telegram `message.send` |
| Denali surface | `denali-integration.surface.ts` — default policy + template |

Payload schema v1:

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "tenantId": "uuid",
  "tourId": "uuid",
  "rowVersion": 1,
  "publishStatus": "active",
  "title": "string | null",
  "occurredAt": "ISO-8601",
  "deliverySnapshot": { }
}
```

`deliverySnapshot` is a frozen copy of `canonical.data` at emit time for field enrichment.

For **Denali**, title lives at canonical path `title` (from `basicInfo.title` ingress projection), not starter `basics.title`. The outbox envelope field `title` may be `null` when `deriveTourProjections` only reads `basics`; dispatch merges `deliverySnapshot` for Telegram formatting.

### Admin UI — deprecated `TourCreated` (denali / telegram)

Persisted `TourCreated` policies are marked `deprecated: true` with `supersededBy: TourPublished` in the effective catalog. Operators configure **TourPublished** under Settings → Exposure. Legacy intents are remapped via INT-002c CLI before go-live.

### `registration.approved`

Existing booking approval event — see bookings repository outbox enqueue.

